ザ缁欎綘鐨勶紝鎷跨潃鍚с�傗��", "鍙告満涓嶆暍鏀剁潃锛氣�滄偍璁╂垜甯�澶у皯濂跺ザ瑙ｅ洿锛屾垜涔熸病甯�涓婁竴鐐瑰効蹇欙紝澶у皯濂跺ザ濂借儐璇嗭紝灏嗛偅涓�鐢蜂汉鍒跺緱蹇冩湇鍙ｆ湇锛岃繕寰椾簡涓嶅皯璧斿伩鍛�銆傗��", "瀛ｆ睙褰辨病璇磋瘽锛屼粬鍧愬湪杞﹂噷锛屼粈涔堥兘鐪嬪埌浜嗐�傞殧寰椾笉杩滐紝杩樺紑鐫�绐楀瓙锛岃繛椤炬祬鍑濈殑璇濅粬閮藉惉寰椾竴娓呬簩妤氥�備互涓哄ス浼氬悡鍝�锛岄偅涓�鑽夊寘濂充汉鈥︹�﹀彧鎬曞ぇ搴�骞夸紬闂瑰嚭绗戣瘽锛屼細琚�濯掍綋澶у仛鏂囩珷涓�浠栫殑鑴搞�傝繖鏍风殑缁撴灉锛屽�掓槸娌℃兂鍒般��", "鐪嬪埌椤炬祬鍑濆紑鐫�鏁炵�疯窇杞︽壃闀胯�屽幓锛屼竴澶存捣婢¤埇鐨勯暱鍙戦殢椋庤垶鍔�锛岀珶鏄�鍔ㄤ汉蹇冮瓌鐨勩��"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "重生之豪门悍女", "content_zh": "春风第一流 （004）不愉快的晚餐顾浅凝皱起眉头，一个豪门千金无知到这种程度，也难怪要被人说成草包大小姐了。空有容貌算什么，还不是花瓶一个。事实上这样的生活她也有些倦怠，况且不能一直指望顾家活下去，生死存亡这种事她不习惯掌握在别人手上。斟酌一下，抬起头：“妈，我以前是不太正干，从今天开始我打算找个事情做。”顾夫人先前眼前一亮，紧接着又湮灭下去。“算了，你这话说过不知多少次了，哪一次不是跟我们撂挑子。”顾浅凝信誓旦旦：“这次一定不会了。”可是干什么呢？顾浅凝没有什么才智。学历她看过了，上了大学还是个三流学校，基本没什么可取之处。除非托关系，否则她寸步难行，在这个城市有几个不知道她是顾浅凝，又有哪个不知道她一无事处的？顾夫人根本不指望她，就像看过《狼来了》的人，都知道顾浅凝是那个孩子的翻版。当务之急是让她抱紧季家这棵大树，找工作什么的，都是次要。“你跟江影到哪一步了？”顾浅凝说：“才有那么点儿熟悉。”顾夫人哑言：“光熟悉可不行，要有实际性的进展才行，越早结婚越好，省着到嘴的鸭子飞走了。”如果不是季江影那只鸭子来电话，顾夫人只怕还要没完没了的说下去。听顾浅凝接起电话，唤了声：“季大少……”马上屏气凝神，比她还要紧张。拿嘴型示意：“跟江影好好说话。”于是顾浅凝将声音放柔一点儿：“有事么？”季江影还是那样冷冷的：“我们是不是一起吃个饭，增加一下爆光率。”真的好刻意。顾浅凝没意见，随口问：“好啊，什么时候？”“就今天晚上吧，我让秘书订餐厅。”顾浅凝挂断电话。顾夫人马上问：“什么事？”“季江影约我吃晚饭。”“那太好了，打扮得漂亮一点儿，男人是视觉动物，只要……”顾浅凝站起身：“行了，你别说了，我都知道了。”顾家人还真好笑，知道自己女儿长在哪里，半点儿不会资源浪费。顾浅凝离开时说：“没有重要的事情不要给我打电话。”顾夫人没头没脑的问她；“你还在生你爸爸的气？”顾浅凝怔了下，倒不知她问的什么。顾夫人挥了挥手：“行了，你快走吧。”那眼眶已然红了。下午早早爬起来，化了妆，换好衣服去赴宴。季江影真是掐着时间过来，准时准点，一分钟不肯多露脸。随行还要带秘书，而且这个漂亮又知性的女人她认识，就是季江影不惜拿命去保的女人。就是在那次事故中，车毁人亡，她才魂穿过来的。就冲这一点，顾浅凝在天之灵足以跟这对男女不共戴天一辈子。季江影看了她一眼：“你先点餐吧。”看来还有资料没有看完，又是个很守时间观念的人。所以带着秘书到这里加班，十几分钟后看完了，递给给安子析。“可以了，拿回去吧。”安子析接到手里，看了下时间，问他：“一个小时之后来接你可以吧？”季江影淡然说：“可以。”聊完公事，安子析这才看过来，跟顾浅凝打招呼。“顾小姐，你好。”顾浅凝抬眸轻笑：“安秘书要不要坐下一起用餐？人多了才热闹。”安子析显得很识趣：“不叨扰二位用餐的雅兴了，祝你们用餐愉快。”等人一走，顾浅凝把菜单丢给季江影：“不好意思，季少，不知道你喜欢吃什么，所以没有给你点。”季江影眯起眼睛，有些冷下脸：“安秘书不是早将我的喜好和生活习惯给你发过去了，你的脑子不是连那些都背不过？”好犀利的讽刺。顾浅凝淡然接招：“是给过我，也早背过了。不过季少忘记了么，我在那场事故中坏了脑子，那些无关紧要的事我怎么还记得。能记得季少这个人，我已经觉得很万幸了，要感谢我的娘亲三舅四姑奶奶了。”她虔诚的说完这一番话，点好的餐已经上来了。顾浅凝拿起工具大方用餐：“季少，我吃饭慢，怕耽误你宝贵时间，我先吃着了。”季江影借着餐厅里的烛光定定看了她须臾。知头醒尾，也听出顾浅凝对于那场事故的怨气了。顾浅凝感觉到一双眼睛的凝视，却眼波不抬，从容吃下一盘食物。擦了下嘴角，才问：“季少，你不吃么？”季江影嘴角抿紧，告诉她：“我不喜欢耍花招的女人。”顾浅凝笑笑：“就算我不耍花招，你也不喜欢我。”季江影到底是修为深厚的人，靠到椅背上懒懒的笑起来。“顾浅凝，看来你比我想象中的聪明。既然什么都知道那很好，我娶你不过就是娶个摆设，豪门这点儿事你该清楚，所以我希望你安份守已做好你的本份，别给我添麻烦。”顾浅凝低眉顺眼：“季少放心，你知道我这个人什么都有，就是没本事，想兴风作浪都无从下手。”季江影只问她：“吃饱了？”见她点头，站起身说：“走吧。”饭局早早散场，跟咽下一堆石头没有分别，跟这样的公子哥吃饭，简直倒尽胃口。驾车往回开，电话响起来。又是那个叫宝丽的女人，看来跟顾浅凝真是很好的朋友，三天两头拉她聚场。想不出要找什么借口推辞，看了一眼将手机扔到一旁不管它。时隔半晌又打来，再看已经换了人。是颜如玉，想了下，接起来：“你好。”那边叫起来：“浅凝，你干什么呢？宝丽给你打电话也不接。”顾浅凝只说：“刚刚在洗澡，没听到。”“难怪呢。”当即又说；“宝丽，安娜我们在一起吃饭，你快过来吧。”顾浅凝说：“我吃过了。”“吃过了也要过来，跟大家坐一坐吧，她们好长时间没见到你了，很担心。”顾浅凝最后只得问了地址驾车过去，却在脑子里狐疑，是多好的朋友，为什么脑子里一点儿印象都没有？", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongshengzhihaomenhannu/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The Best Spring Breeze (004) Unpleasant Dinner Gu Qianning frowned. For a wealthy daughter to be so ignorant, it is no wonder that she would be called a loser. Appearance is nothing, it’s just a vase. In fact, she was a little tired of living such a life, and she couldn't always count on the Gu family to survive. She was not used to having life and death in other people's hands. After thinking about it for a moment, he raised his head and said, \"Mom, I was not very serious in the past. Starting from today, I plan to find something to do.\" Mrs. Gu's eyes lit up before, and then disappeared again. \"Forget it, I don't know how many times you have said this, but every time you have not given up on us.\" Gu Qianning vowed: \"It won't happen this time.\" But what to do? Gu Qianning has no talent. She had looked at her academic qualifications. She went to college and it was still a third-rate school with basically no redeeming features. Unless she has some connections, she can't move forward. There are a few people in this city who don't know that she is Gu Qianning, and who doesn't know that she has nothing to do? Mrs. Gu didn't expect her at all, just like anyone who had watched \"The Boy Who Cried Wolf\" knew that Gu Qianning was the replica of that child. The top priority was to get her to hug the big tree of the Ji family tightly, and finding a job was secondary. \"How far are you and Jiang Ying?\" Gu Qianning said, \"We are just a little bit familiar.\" Mrs. Gu said dumbly: \"Familiarity alone is not enough, there must be practical progress. The sooner you get married, the better. The duck that saved your money will fly away.\" If Ji Jiangying's duck hadn't called, Mrs. Gu would have continued talking endlessly. Gu Qianning answered the phone and called out: \"Young Master Ji...\" She immediately held her breath and concentrated, even more nervous than she was. She gestured with her mouth: \"Talk to Jiang Ying.\" So Gu Qianning softened her voice and said, \"Is something wrong?\" Ji Jiangying was still as cold as ever: \"Shall we have a meal together to increase the exposure rate.\" It's so deliberate. Gu Qianning had no objection and asked casually: \"Okay, when?\" \"Just tonight, I'll ask the secretary to book a restaurant.\" Gu Qianning hung up the phone. Mrs. Gu immediately asked: \"What's the matter?\" \"Ji Jiangying asked me to have dinner.\" \"That's great, dress up nicely, men are visual creatures, as long as...\" Gu Qianning stood up: \"Okay, stop talking, I know everything.\" The Gu family is really funny, knowing where their daughter grew up, and they will not waste resources at all. When Gu Qianning left, she said, \"Don't call me unless there is something important.\" Mrs. Gu asked her confusedly, \"Are you still angry with your father?\" Gu Qianing was stunned for a moment, not knowing what she was asking. Mrs. Gu waved her hand: \"Okay, you can leave quickly.\" Her eyes were already red. I got up early in the afternoon, put on makeup, changed clothes and went to the banquet. Ji Jiangying really took the time to come here, on time, and refused to show her face for more than a minute. She also had to bring a secretary with her, and she knew this beautiful and intellectual woman, the woman Ji Jiangying risked his life to protect. It was in that accident that the car crashed and everyone was killed, and she came back through it. Just for this reason, Gu Qianning's spirit in heaven was enough to be at odds with this man and woman for the rest of their lives. Ji Jiangying glanced at her: \"You order food first.\" It seemed that there was still information to read, and he was a very punctual person. So I brought my secretary here to work overtime. After ten minutes, I finished reading it and handed it to An Zixi. \"Okay, take it back.\" An Zixi took it in his hand, looked at the time, and asked him, \"Can I pick you up in an hour?\" Ji Jiangying said calmly, \"Okay.\" After chatting about business, An Zixi looked over and greeted Gu Qianning. \"Hello, Miss Gu.\" Gu Qianning raised her eyes and smiled softly: \"Secretary An, do you want to sit down and have a meal together? It's more lively when there are more people.\" An Zixi seemed very sensible: \"I won't disturb your enjoyment of the meal. I wish you a pleasant meal.\" As soon as the others left, Gu Qianning threw the menu to Ji Jiangying: \"I'm sorry, Mr. Ji, I didn't know what you like to eat, so I didn't give you any.\" Ji Jiangying narrowed his eyes and looked a little coldly: \"Didn't Secretary An send you my preferences and living habits a long time ago, and your brain can't even memorize them?\" What a sharp irony. Gu Qianning accepted the call calmly: \"You gave it to me, and I have already recited it. But has Mr. Ji forgotten? My brain was damaged in that accident. How can I still remember those insignificant things. I feel very lucky to be able to remember Mr. Ji. I have to thank my mother-in-law, uncle and aunt.\" After she said this piously, the meal she ordered was served. Gu Qianning picked up the tools and ate generously: \"Master Ji, I eat slowly, for fear of wasting your precious time, so I will eat first.\" Ji Jiangying looked at her for a moment through the candlelight in the restaurant. When he woke up, he could also hear Gu Qianning's resentment about the accident. Gu Qianning felt a pair of eyes staring at her, but she didn't look up and calmly ate a plate of food. After wiping the corner of his mouth, he asked, \"Master Ji, don't you want to eat?\" Ji Jiangying tightened his lips and told her, \"I don't like women who play tricks.\" Gu Qianning smiled and said, \"Even if I don't play tricks, you don't like me either.\" Ji Jiangying was a person with profound cultivation after all. He leaned back in his chair and smiled lazily. \"Gu Qianning, it seems that you are smarter than I thought. Since you know everything, that's good. I'm just marrying you for decoration. You should know this about a wealthy family, so I hope you will do your job well and don't cause me trouble.\" Gu Qianning lowered her eyebrows and said, \"Don't worry, Mr. Ji, you know I have everything, but I don't have the ability to make trouble.\" Ji Jiangying just asked her, \"Have you eaten?\" Seeing her nodding, he stood up and said, \"Let's go.\" The dinner ended early, which was the same as swallowing a pile of stones. Eating with such a young man was simply unappetizing. Driving back, the phone rang. It’s that woman named Baoli again,", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}